            "sid": "GEN 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Adamu aikele imyaka umwanda umo na makumi yatatu (130) elyo afyele umwana umwaume uwamupala, uwaba mu cata cakwe, amwinika ne shina lya Seti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panuma ya kufyalwa kwakwa Seti, Adamu aikele imyaka imyanda cine konse konse (800), kabili alifyele na bambi abana abaume na banakashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imyaka yonse pamo Adamu aikele umumi yali imyanda pabula na makumi yatatu (930), elyo afwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
